---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';


---

<Layout 
  title="How It Works | Ask Astro Raja"
  description="Discover the 3-step process to getting complete clarity on your life path. Provide your stars, answer 4 questions about your current reality, and instantly download your personal Vedic report."
>
  
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-light-bg relative overflow-hidden border-b border-brand-border/50">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-10">
      <img src="/images/light_mandala_pattern.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative z-10 text-center">
      <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">The Process</div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] mb-6 text-brand-navy">
        Deep Wisdom, <br />
        <span class="gradient-text-light">Delivered Simply.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-text max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        We've removed the friction from traditional astrology consultations. No back-and-forth messaging. Just three simple steps to complete clarity.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-white relative">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="space-y-24">
        
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 group">
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 order-2 md:order-1">
            <div class="bg-brand-light-bg border border-brand-border rounded-3xl p-8 relative shadow-lg transform group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500">
              <div class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full border border-brand-border flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm">
                <span class="text-brand-saffron text-2xl">☽</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-saffron uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Form Section 1</h4>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Your Cosmic Identity</h3>
              <p class="text-brand-text leading-relaxed">
                We start with the core pillars of Vedic astrology. You simply select your <strong>Raasi</strong> (Moon Sign) and <strong>Lagnam</strong> (Ascendant) from our dropdown menus, and type in your exact <strong>Nakshatra</strong> (Birth Star).
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 order-1 md:order-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
              <div class="text-8xl font-bold text-brand-border/40 select-none">01</div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Provide Your Basics</h2>
                <p class="text-brand-text">No complicated birth charts or exact longitude calculations required from you. Just the names of your stars.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 group">
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 text-right">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6 justify-end">
              <div class="text-right">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Answer 4 Questions</h2>
                <p class="text-brand-text">This is where the magic happens. We map your stars directly to your current reality.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="text-8xl font-bold text-brand-border/40 select-none">02</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-brand-border rounded-3xl p-8 relative shadow-lg transform group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500">
              <div class="absolute -left-4 -top-4 w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full border border-brand-border flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm">
                <span class="text-brand-saffron text-2xl">◎</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-saffron uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Form Section 2</h4>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">Your Current Reality</h3>
              <p class="text-brand-text leading-relaxed">
                Instead of a generic horoscope, we ask you to select your current struggles (e.g. career confusion, relationship stress), your daily life rhythm, and your ultimate goals. This allows our AI to generate highly specific, actionable advice.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 group">
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 order-2 md:order-1">
            <div class="bg-brand-navy border border-brand-navy-light rounded-3xl p-8 relative shadow-xl transform group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 text-white">
              <div class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-12 h-12 bg-brand-navy rounded-full border border-brand-navy-light flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm">
                <span class="text-brand-saffron text-2xl">↓</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-saffron uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">The Result</h4>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Your Personal Report</h3>
              <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
                A beautiful, comprehensive document outlining your core strengths, an analysis of your current challenges based on planetary transits, and practical spiritual remedies (like specific temples to visit or mantras to chant).
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 order-1 md:order-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
              <div class="text-8xl font-bold text-brand-border/40 select-none">03</div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Download instantly</h2>
                <p class="text-brand-text">Within minutes of submission, your personalized guidance is ready to download and read.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-brand-light-bg text-center border-t border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">Experience the process now.</h2>
      <a href="/#form-section" class="inline-block px-10 py-5 rounded-full bg-brand-saffron text-white font-bold text-xl hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-lg">
        Begin My Reading
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
